WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.671
Three module conjectures fail.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:06.743
These conjectures all say a module with no self-extensions must be projective.

3
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.300
A symmetric algebra with a rigid module;

4
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:13.901
its endomorphism algebra then breaks Nakayama too.

5
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.547
Claimed: counterexamples over a field of characteristic two.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.237
Main theorem Lean-checked.
